note SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
note 100% Pure Seeded-Omega Zero-CUDA Real-Weight End-to-End Qwen 3.6 35B-A3B FP8 Decoder (q36-decode).
note ZERO libcuda.so.1, ZERO libc, ZERO Python, ZERO C, ZERO Rust.
note Loads ALL 40 real layers (layers-0..39.safetensors, ~33.6 GB) + outside.safetensors (lm_head, embed, norm)
note directly into GB10 UVM, quantizes lm_head on-GPU to W4 block-32 (1.26 ms two-pass exact),
note runs real 40-layer GDN + Full-Attn + 256E top-8 MoE + Arboris prefill & greedy decode on GB10 silicon!
note Compose after:
note   gpu/nvidia/native/nvrm/context.om
note   gpu/nvidia/native/blackwell/vector.om
note   gpu/nvidia/native/blackwell/launch.om
note   gpu/nvidia/native/blackwell/batch.om
note   om/encoder/bw_enc_sm121.om
note   om/gpu/q36/emit_fast.om
note   om/gpu/q36/head/emit_head.om
note   om/gpu/q36/arboris/prefetch.om

